  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tier 2 Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Case study for PIE T2 Reporting- Enrolments.
&#x200d;
PIE works to improve learning outcomes at the early grades in four Provinces. In its first year, the program has provided textbooks and teacher training for 41,000 students (48% girls).  
&#x200d;
Additionally, a &#x2018;Back-to-School&#x2019; nation-wide communication campaign in January targeted parents and students to highlight the importance of registering and attending school from the start of the academic year and staying in school. The campaign used text messages (100,000), TV, radio, newspaper, online media messages (300,000) to an estimated total of 4 million viewers.</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-07-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-06-30"></period-end>
    </period>
